		(property "Description" "ST IIS2DLPC 3-axis accelerometer (industrial grade, ST 10-year longevity commitment; replaces the LIS2DH, which distributors list as obsolete): tilt compensation for U10 + knock/move detect on INT1 (tap, double-tap, wake-up). I2C 7-bit address 0x19 (SA0 strapped to Vdd_IO via R414; fit R415/remove R414 for 0x18) -- DocID031788 Rev 4, \"SAD associated to the IIS2DLPC is 001100xb\". CS (pin 2) tied high for I2C (sec 4). RES (pin 7) to GND, NC pin 5 unconnected (Table 2). Vdd (pin 9) 100nF + 10uF (sec 4). 14-bit, 0.244 mg/digit at +/-2 g (Table 4); Vdd 1.62-3.6V, Vdd_IO 1.62..Vdd+0.1V (Table 5)."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(unlocked yes)
