		(property "Description" "ST IIS2MDC 3-axis magnetometer (industrial grade, ST 10-year longevity commitment): the station HEADING. Replaces the LIS3MDL, terminated by ST PCN 15054. I2C 7-bit address 0x1E, fixed (DocID030986 Rev 1 Table 21, default address 0011110b) -- no address strap. CS (pin 3) tied to Vdd_IO for I2C mode (Table 2, sec 5). C1 (pin 5) = 220nF low ESR (max 200 mOhm), as close as possible to pins 5 and 6 (Table 2, sec 5). Vdd (pin 9) 100nF + 10uF (sec 5). One INT/DRDY output (pin 7) -> MAG_INT. NC pins 2/11/12 left unconnected. Siting: keep >10mA currents a few mm away (sec 5.2) -- see sheet keep-out note."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(unlocked yes)
			(layer "F.Fab")
			(hide yes)
